      "english": "Pretty suspicious...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A360",
      "source_words_sha256": "cd09995b37d66266c646a52ba453d0e9d27764c63a22bb95d62fd22ab5865d98",
      "english": "Good work, then.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A378",
      "source_words_sha256": "1fcdb6ee1b96d2a5256d92c430f2ffd3c222251c23dd5823feda2ae3a1bee543",
      "english": "Are you an IDIOT?! How many times?! This isn't a WIG!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A518",
      "source_words_sha256": "95dcd0cf255ba08eb767093aec46049ca412a534b635c6aa94362f69cfdc9867",
      "english": "You're yakuza, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A534",
      "source_words_sha256": "37c291d89db22178124105e41b25d7187229185144d517b8878164717820d585",
      "english": "Lose the punch perm first. Bad for your image.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A574",
      "source_words_sha256": "3d5991460f55c14568b9a0887f35df3b7f3b35cf86aadc6e3b69587cb4f80d21",
      "english": "Then ditch the punch perm.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A5A0",
      "source_words_sha256": "378dc0a036a52e3bfa99ed3072c45029e847de234e7d5c37a8f563034bdaeef4",
      "english": "The punch perm or the gang? Decide that much yourself.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A5F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "f2ff77c0af7fc33fcdd89734b4514361bbab6bc0e8b697d5f4629ddf842c915e",
      "english": "Yakuza, yes. But the Punch Gang wants to be loved!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
