      "source_words_sha256": "95b65a963a4ee295f6e718d847296df98ce0ad14a4ebd466b9ab5decb17367d0",
      "english": "Boss'd get mad and kick me out of the Punch Gang!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006A79C",
